Notebook[{
Cell["[ LLM Generated ]", "Author",
 CellID->1,ExpressionUUID->"c284c064-d24e-49d3-8338-7b7efc9fe713"],

Cell["\<\
The counting bound for Sidon sets in cyclic groups, and where it is attained\
\>", "Title",
 CellID->2,ExpressionUUID->"86a927af-db40-460a-8063-ba7b0c7e728c"],

Cell["Claude Opus 5 (claude-opus-5[1m])", "Author",
 CellID->3,ExpressionUUID->"6fe01f1c-d90d-4ff6-b895-f2fe892e17b2"],

Cell["2026-08-21", "Date",
 CellID->4,ExpressionUUID->"c55feab4-866c-4e0c-a3fb-55a14656634f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Operator: Pavel H\[AAcute]jek. ",
 StyleBox["Open exploration",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] asked for a short paper carrying material below the settled \
tier, so that the tier rules could be exercised with the journal off; no \
topic, method or target statement was named."
}], "Date",
 CellID->5,ExpressionUUID->"0747cf5b-f872-4ed4-b44a-2de08e419c02"],

Cell["Abstract", "Section",
 CellID->6,ExpressionUUID->"fb8fb42a-011e-4250-b7d9-46fffb2de5f7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A Sidon set in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11febe2c-b0c8-4b4c-a81e-6e2df42a9795"],
 " has all of its nonzero differences distinct, which bounds its size by \
roughly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3d71a059-7d1f-4916-9e51-4f5c09febfd9"],
 ". We prove that bound by counting differences, and we determine the first \
cyclic group in which it is not attained. The bound holds for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9e2df34d-fbc9-4433-8513-f7ed5b1885f7"],
 ", and it is attained for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4baa895d-efbc-4cdf-bab5-c623ae7c5237"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"3", "\[LessEqual]", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "21"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c650b7ca-a69e-4a18-ba74-07e306023a85"],
 " and not for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "22"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "55f660b7-50bc-4e1d-868c-5d2dccf4bf83"],
 ". The search that settles the negative half is a finite enumeration and is \
reproduced below."
}], "Text",
 CellID->7,ExpressionUUID->"bc29f15f-f7c0-4367-8d8d-479c74ff84fc"],

Cell["Introduction", "Section",
 CellID->8,ExpressionUUID->"3222dddd-50a4-464f-9ebf-14a014fd7727"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A set of integers is a Sidon set when its pairwise differences are \
distinct, and the cyclic version of the condition asks for the differences to \
be distinct modulo ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e319c7dc-ab70-427b-839b-9b93cd1153af"],
 ". The condition is restrictive: distinct differences cannot repeat and \
there are only ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "461631c0-a8ff-4776-8208-70a22d2ea2bc"],
 " nonzero residues to hold them, so a Sidon set in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f372eabe-47a4-45c0-8692-0beac25fed31"],
 " has about ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e2aec536-05cd-45e4-9ece-fc919abc5464"],
 " elements at most. This paper writes that counting argument out and then \
asks whether the resulting bound is met."
}], "Text",
 CellID->9,ExpressionUUID->"ffa14c84-640d-45d1-9f36-31d3fe296639"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The bound is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftFloor]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{"4", 
          StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "3"}]]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], 
     "\[RightFloor]"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c97ecfd6-291d-4c70-ba69-461863aecad1"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], "(", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b3e6fd30-f782-41e4-8f9d-04b2920e4935"],
 " is the largest size of a Sidon set in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8f50b07a-7456-45c1-8aab-d5ecd233d2c5"],
 ", and it is proved in ",
 ButtonBox["(",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Thm:Bound"],
 ButtonBox[
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "Thm:Bound"],
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Thm:Bound"],
 ButtonBox[")",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Thm:Bound"],
 ". It is attained for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35d48827-26c7-4283-9f63-6251f274b9d3"],
 " from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["3", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "88aa9313-d640-40ef-bf87-137e253cd8ae"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["21", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "abb76272-5a27-4011-99a6-05c062a6d839"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "22", ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c6cdf595-dfc4-4391-b68b-8b23d34368a5"],
 " while the bound at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["22", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e37b1c79-2a85-4c47-9aeb-210b8725b7f8"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["5", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4401ba1c-5a67-4acd-8f86-8cb0fd3db5b8"],
 ", by ",
 ButtonBox["Proposition ",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Prop:First"],
 ButtonBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Prop:First"],
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Prop:First"],
 ButtonBox[".",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Prop:First"],
 ButtonBox[
 CounterBox["Theorem", "Prop:First"],
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Prop:First"],
 ". The negative half of that statement is a finite check rather than an \
argument, and the enumeration behind it is stated in ",
 StyleBox["Ruliology", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->10,ExpressionUUID->"6fd85ab3-ad97-4ca5-9776-97168bb9d3ab"],

Cell["\<\
Section 2 fixes the definitions and proves the bound. Section 3 settles \
attainment up to the first failure. The closing question asks whether \
failures continue.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->11,ExpressionUUID->"81ec73fa-828d-48bf-80d6-8168cff85588"],

Cell["The counting bound", "Section",
 CellID->12,ExpressionUUID->"8675231f-afa6-41c4-9458-022c36858efb"],

Cell["\<\
This section fixes the two objects the paper is about and bounds one by the \
other.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->13,ExpressionUUID->"b373cca3-56e4-4605-a0de-3819953d4faf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[GreaterEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bc7c1912-69f1-42f4-a297-ac905b268bca"],
 ". A subset ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[SubsetEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ca939ce-b449-4ca9-a0cf-59dbe5722fab"],
 " is a ",
 StyleBox["Sidon set", "TI"],
 " if the differences ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "384d0b36-b1de-46bf-b45e-ef39e5fecb4a"],
 ", taken over all ordered pairs of distinct ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], "\[Element]", 
    StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f47fe777-989d-4c17-9cc5-928537f8e464"],
 ", are pairwise distinct in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "80de4ca5-2526-44a8-b118-2e42e316094b"],
 "."
}], "Definition",
 CellTags->"Def:Sidon",
 CellID->14,ExpressionUUID->"1db97989-7838-4c1e-862a-94a16a2ab58f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "7"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e716ba91-e462-4bc1-bd52-11f073f50b01"],
 " the set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "3"}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b838ffc8-f04b-4291-83f9-9679fbc8271b"],
 " is a Sidon set: its six differences are the six nonzero residues, each \
once."
}], "Example",
 CellID->15,ExpressionUUID->"329bb9af-54d3-42cf-b9f7-6c19447f2ad5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Sort", "[", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Mod", "[", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], ",", " ", "7"}], " ", "]"}], " ", 
    "&"}], " ", "@@@", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Select", "[", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", " ", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "3"}], " ", "}"}], ",", " ", 
       "2"}], " ", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Apply", "[", " ", "Unequal", " ", "]"}]}], " ", "]"}]}], " ", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellID->16,ExpressionUUID->"d4d70a25-5e81-489d-b9de-65ce2c5107d6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", "3", ",", "4", ",", "5", ",", "6"}], 
  "}"}]], "Output",
 CellID->17,ExpressionUUID->"048c5307-d43f-4f23-9bd3-70c8de6cae4a"]
}, {2}]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[GreaterEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2e4ab13a-9176-44fe-a59e-e5de9ef6c426"],
 " let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], "(", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "438ebcff-3767-49b3-8697-dba047056723"],
 " denote the largest size of a Sidon set in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "61aba322-603a-45cf-806d-7186469defe9"],
 "."
}], "Definition",
 CellTags->"Def:MaxSize",
 CellID->18,ExpressionUUID->"0fc5397c-b728-413c-b26a-64f5f7ba23a7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "7", ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00334869-3cab-4ca0-9dd7-bf7819e94dcc"],
 ", the set of the previous example being one of the largest."
}], "Example",
 CellID->19,ExpressionUUID->"526037db-05c8-4e03-ad6a-decd3797f07e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"maxSidon", "[", " ", "7", " ", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellID->20,ExpressionUUID->"cf675117-87a1-43de-ae17-8a671d7fe655"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"3", ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellID->21,ExpressionUUID->"e58e832c-1ff1-4934-874a-1202fe35093c"]
}, {2}]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[GreaterEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74d797ce-3295-4186-9533-6d34c94b00d3"],
 ","
}], "Theorem",
 CellID->22,ExpressionUUID->"df5ad583-2206-493e-8187-b4a8e539595d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"4", 
        StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "3"}]]}], "2"], "."}],
   TraditionalForm],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellTags->"Thm:Bound",
 CellID->23,ExpressionUUID->"9e985f2c-1b84-42d8-82e1-dd75f08b5b92"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[SubsetEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "95b0befc-de28-4947-b6bd-c3c0491aedf9"],
 " be a Sidon set and put ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "|", 
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "|"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd697976-d8fa-4136-a2dc-ca1c2fc27c35"],
 ". There are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "(", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-", "1"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b200b92e-05cf-4b58-8f6a-52d75c04a2b2"],
 " ordered pairs of distinct elements of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["A", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ed5db679-fcd5-4bf6-948b-e6903d7cd9da"],
 ", and each contributes a difference ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f857961-a2b6-4b8f-bf44-201648c28730"],
 ". Each such difference is nonzero, since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[NotEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11ddcfe7-4d64-4993-a697-d050437bf63f"],
 " in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3a6845ee-1840-4464-bebe-562e80cc7974"],
 ". The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "(", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-", "1"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "90ce6874-2dc8-4250-93f6-fc60614965bb"],
 " differences are pairwise distinct by ",
 ButtonBox["Definition ",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Def:Sidon"],
 ButtonBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Def:Sidon"],
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Def:Sidon"],
 ButtonBox[".",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Def:Sidon"],
 ButtonBox[
 CounterBox["Theorem", "Def:Sidon"],
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Def:Sidon"],
 ", so they are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "(", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-", "1"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9fb62778-d9e2-4854-8384-35082cafb597"],
 " distinct nonzero elements of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "758b793f-faee-4a46-8d22-a47ba0ff6afb"],
 ". There are exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f70fd470-503c-45dd-a03c-c7d373ce05b9"],
 " nonzero elements available, whence ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0ff1e0b4-f283-43a3-8abf-9de547f4a5fd"],
 ". So ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ce831cb8-4c01-4e39-bee1-c74162ff449d"],
 " satisfies ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "2"], "-", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", "0"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "db523112-1264-42f2-a0b1-06bd400c51aa"],
 ", and since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[GreaterEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2061ef71-6f67-4f20-a326-02091bace576"],
 " this holds precisely when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25224532-26b7-4d5b-9742-61ff636d693e"],
 " is at most the positive root ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"4", 
        StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "3"}]]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9f8cde34-7812-45e4-8dcf-c5bcaeca9d76"],
 ". Taking the largest such ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "df26def7-bab4-47cc-b94c-4b34abfafe97"],
 " over all Sidon sets gives [Eq:Bound] by ",
 ButtonBox["Definition ",
  BaseStyle->"Citation",
  ButtonData->"Def:MaxSize"],
 ButtonBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Def:MaxSize"],
